# Everything the processing pipeline writes into the sample datasets is
# ignored: grouped image subdirs (001/, 002/, ...), filemod_list.csv,
# 0_analysis_output/, CTD-*.csv, ImageTime.csv, Depth.csv,
# Data-Breakpoints.csv, ProcData_*.csv, and so on.
#
# The sample datasets already committed to the repo stay tracked and still
# arrive with a normal clone -- .gitignore never applies to files git is
# already tracking. This only hides NEW files created locally.
#
# To commit a genuinely new sample dataset, force it: git add -f <path>
*
!.gitignore
